  "content": "## Overview\n\n**Lorem Ipsum** is standard placeholder dummy text widely used in publishing, graphic design, and UI/UX design. Its purpose is to demonstrate visual elements, typography, and layout flow without distracting viewers with readable copy.\n\nOur browser-native **Lorem Ipsum Generator** creates instant placeholder content by paragraphs, sentences, or word counts with optional HTML paragraph tag wrapping.\n\n---\n\n## The Historical Origin of Lorem Ipsum\n\nContrary to popular belief, Lorem Ipsum is not simply random nonsense. It has roots in a piece of classical Latin literature dating back to 45 BC. \n\nIn 1982, classics professor **Richard McClintock** tracked down the source to Cicero's philosophical treatise *\"De Finibus Bonorum et Malorum\"* (On the Extremes of Good and Evil). The standard passage comes from section 1.10.32:\n> *\"Neque porro quisquam est qui dolorem ipsum quia dolor sit amet, consectetur, adipisci velit...\"*\n> (*\"Nor is there anyone who loves, pursues, or desires pain itself because it is pain...\"*)\n\nIn the 1960s, Letraset popularized adhesive sheets containing Lorem Ipsum passages, and desktop publishing software like Aldus PageMaker later brought it to modern computing.\n\n---\n\n## Why Designers Rely on Placeholder Text\n\n1. **Eliminates Content Bias**: When clients review wireframes with actual readable content, discussions inevitably drift toward copy editing rather than visual hierarchy, layout balance, and responsive design.\n2. **Realistic Natural Letter Frequency**: Unlike repetitive test strings like \"asdf\" or \"test test test\", Latin vocabulary approximates natural English letter distributions and word length variances.\n3. **Typography Stress Testing**: Evaluates font kerning, line height, paragraph margins, and visual weight across different viewport sizes.\n\n---\n\n## Step-by-Step Instructions\n\n1. **Choose Unit**: Select whether you need **Paragraphs**, **Sentences**, or **Words**.\n2. **Set Count**: Enter the desired quantity (e.g. 3 paragraphs or 50 words).\n3. **Options**: Check or uncheck \"Start with Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet...\" or enable HTML paragraph tags.\n4. **Copy**: Click the **Copy Text** button to paste directly into Figma, Sketch, VS Code, or your CMS."
